              "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
              "source": "PubMed",
              "id": "2536744"
            }
          ],
          "value": "Inhibited by L-leucine hydroxamate and phosphoramidon. Not inhibited by phenylmethanesulfonyl fluoride. Reversibly inactivated by straight-chain aliphatic alcohols"
        }
      ],
      "commentType": "ACTIVITY REGULATION"
    },
